- please run " pip install -r requirements.txt" to get the appropriate packages for this project.
- Project will be ran on a independently developed youtube transcript API
- The base model is credited to GeeksForGeeks, but was optimized for better accuracy.
- Languages used here are python in th ebackend and Javascript and html for the front end. Please read the requirements.txt for required packages as well as suggested packages commented. 
- To run this project:
    - Navigate to the terminal
    - type in "node server.js"
    - follow the link to the local host
    - copy and paste a youtube web browser link into the text bar and click "Analyze"
    - after result are shown you will be prompted to provide feedback on the accurcay of the precdiction. We would like to note that this feedback is quite performative...but appreciated nonetheless.. 